{"file": "D:\\SpaceBook\\_cls7_jpg\\drawing\\010.jpg", "lines": [{"text": "Water colours", "conf": 0.888, "box": [[100, 52], [406, 22], [410, 62], [104, 92]]}, {"text": "the best quality if you can afford. If", "conf": 0.885, "box": [[83, 224], [814, 193], [817, 249], [86, 280]]}, {"text": "squeeze out a little amount of paint", "conf": 0.903, "box": [[75, 351], [818, 328], [820, 390], [77, 413]]}, {"text": "on your palette. A little is usually", "conf": 0.918, "box": [[74, 415], [811, 399], [812, 462], [75, 477]]}, {"text": "enough. If you are left with excess of", "conf": 0.93, "box": [[75, 483], [814, 471], [815, 526], [76, 538]]}, {"text": "paint, it is almost impossible to put it", "conf": 0.918, "box": [[72, 548], [815, 541], [815, 601], [73, 608]]}, {"text": "back into the tube. However, if you", "conf": 0.912, "box": [[72, 612], [810, 616], [810, 669], [72, 665]]}, {"text": "are left with some paint, and you", "conf": 0.917, "box": [[72, 681], [810, 691], [809, 740], [71, 730]]}, {"text": "find it dried on the next use, you can", "conf": 0.907, "box": [[70, 747], [813, 761], [812, 810], [69, 796]]}, {"text": "still use it. Just add a few drops of", "conf": 0.892, "box": [[70, 814], [813, 829], [812, 878], [69, 863]]}, {"text": "water to it and after a minute you", "conf": 0.881, "box": [[66, 879], [812, 899], [811, 952], [65, 932]]}, {"text": "can use it.", "conf": 0.9, "box": [[68, 954], [263, 957], [262, 1001], [67, 998]]}, {"text": "If your water colours come in cake form, mix the colours on the palette and avoid", "conf": 0.929, "box": [[67, 1014], [1659, 1051], [1658, 1100], [66, 1063]]}, {"text": "mixing on the cakes. Always cap the tubes tightly.after use.", "conf": 0.926, "box": [[65, 1082], [1241, 1111], [1240, 1160], [64, 1131]]}, {"text": "ingila", "conf": 0.719, "box": [[770, 1194], [896, 1133], [919, 1179], [793, 1240]]}, {"text": "Water Containers", "conf": 0.863, "box": [[804, 1243], [1229, 1254], [1228, 1297], [803, 1286]]}, {"text": "You 'mu